{"probe": "tools", "result": {"id": 1, "jsonrpc": "2.0", "result": {"tools": [{"description": "Current minute, minutes left on shift, error rate and revenue per minute of each\n    customer-facing (edge) service, mitigations still in progress and throttles that are on.", "inputSchema": {"properties": {}, "title": "get_statusArguments", "type": "object"}, "name": "get_status", "outputSchema": {"properties": {"result": {"title": "Result", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["result"], "title": "get_statusOutput", "type": "object"}}, {"description": "Every service: tier (edge, app, data, or external for one hosted outside the estate), normal\n    replica count, and which services it calls. A hard dependency passes all of its failures to the\n    caller, a soft one about 30%. Where the instruction covers retries, also how many times callers\n    retry a failed call to it; where it covers generated files, also the service it loads one from.", "inputSchema": {"properties": {}, "title": "get_topologyArguments", "type": "object"}, "name": "get_topology", "outputSchema": {"properties": {"result": {"title": "Result", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["result"], "title": "get_topologyOutput", "type": "object"}}, {"description": "Alerts firing now: error_rate >= 0.05, cpu >= 0.9 or mem >= 0.9, with the minute each began.\n    The instruction says whether the list is complete and whether `tier` (edge, app, data) applies.", "inputSchema": {"properties": {"tier": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Tier"}}, "title": "list_alertsArguments", "type": "object"}, "name": "list_alerts", "outputSchema": {"properties": {"result": {"title": "Result", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["result"], "title": "list_alertsOutput", "type": "object"}}, {"description": "Recent metrics of one service: error_rate, p99_ms, rps, cpu, mem, replicas and restarts in\n    the last 30 minutes. The instruction says how far one call reaches and whether `until_minute`\n    (the minute the window ends, not in the future) applies.", "inputSchema": {"properties": {"service": {"title": "Service", "type": "string"}, "until_minute": {"anyOf": [{"type": "integer"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Until Minute"}}, "required": ["service"], "title": "get_metricsArguments", "type": "object"}, "name": "get_metrics", "outputSchema": {"properties": {"result": {"title": "Result", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["result"], "title": "get_metricsOutput", "type": "object"}}, {"description": "Log lines of one service over 10 minutes, grouped by message with counts. The instruction\n    says whether `until_minute` (the minute the window ends, not in the future) applies.", "inputSchema": {"properties": {"service": {"title": "Service", "type": "string"}, "until_minute": {"anyOf": [{"type": "integer"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Until Minute"}}, "required": ["service"], "title": "get_logsArguments", "type": "object"}, "name": "get_logs", "outputSchema": {"properties": {"result": {"title": "Result", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["result"], "title": "get_logsOutput", "type": "object"}}, {"description": "Deploys and config changes of one service in the last 24 hours (minutes are relative to\n    the page, so negative means before it).", "inputSchema": {"properties": {"service": {"title": "Service", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["service"], "title": "get_changesArguments", "type": "object"}, "name": "get_changes", "outputSchema": {"properties": {"result": {"title": "Result", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["result"], "title": "get_changesOutput", "type": "object"}}, {"description": "What one deploy or config change of a service did, by the id `get_changes` shows. The\n    instruction says whether this tool applies.", "inputSchema": {"properties": {"change_id": {"title": "Change Id", "type": "string"}, "service": {"title": "Service", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["service", "change_id"], "title": "get_diffArguments", "type": "object"}, "name": "get_diff", "outputSchema": {"properties": {"result": {"title": "Result", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["result"], "title": "get_diffOutput", "type": "object"}}, {"description": "Roll back the service's most recent live deploy. The instruction says how long it takes\n    and how many requests fail meanwhile.", "inputSchema": {"properties": {"service": {"title": "Service", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["service"], "title": "rollbackArguments", "type": "object"}, "name": "rollback", "outputSchema": {"properties": {"result": {"title": "Result", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["result"], "title": "rollbackOutput", "type": "object"}}, {"description": "Revert the service's most recent live config change. Timing is in the instruction.", "inputSchema": {"properties": {"service": {"title": "Service", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["service"], "title": "revert_configArguments", "type": "object"}, "name": "revert_config", "outputSchema": {"properties": {"result": {"title": "Result", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["result"], "title": "revert_configOutput", "type": "object"}}, {"description": "Restart every instance of the service. The instruction says how long it takes and how\n    many requests fail meanwhile; a data-tier service is fully down.", "inputSchema": {"properties": {"service": {"title": "Service", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["service"], "title": "restartArguments", "type": "object"}, "name": "restart", "outputSchema": {"properties": {"result": {"title": "Result", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["result"], "title": "restartOutput", "type": "object"}}, {"description": "Set the replica count (1 to 4x normal). Timing is in the instruction. Replicas above\n    normal cost money for the rest of the shift.", "inputSchema": {"properties": {"replicas": {"title": "Replicas", "type": "integer"}, "service": {"title": "Service", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["service", "replicas"], "title": "scaleArguments", "type": "object"}, "name": "